# Ignore rules for the backend image only.
#
# BuildKit prefers <dockerfile>.dockerignore over the context root's
# .dockerignore. That root file excludes backend/ and frontend/ because it was
# written for the Python service, whose context is also the repo root -- and
# with the backend now building from the root (so widget/ is reachable), those
# rules would exclude the very source being built.
#
# So: everything out, then the two directories this image needs back in.
*
!backend/.mvn/
!backend/mvnw
!backend/pom.xml
!backend/src/
!widget/src/
!widget/package.json
!widget/package-lock.json
!widget/tsconfig.json
!widget/build.mjs

# Build output and local state that must never reach the image.
**/target/
**/node_modules/
**/.git/
**/__pycache__/
